  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social justice - strenghtening the student bodies and voice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centre for Sexualities Aids and Gender identity at the University of Pretoria collaborate with five other univerisities in the region on student leadership and awareness of LGBTI issues. Strenghten student bodies,  and work with the documentation of harrasment on campus.</narrative>
  </description>
